      "content": "vermilion, cinnabar or red crystalline mercuric sulphide, esp. in later use that obtained artificially, much valued on account of its brilliant scarlet colour, and largely used as a pigment or in the manufacture of red sealing-wax (OED s.v. vermilion n. and a.) | a fabric dyed with vermilion"
